{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33901","headline":"忆洞庭观步十韵 · 皮日休","name":"忆洞庭观步十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前时登观步，暑雨正铮摐。\n上戍看绵蕝，登村度石矼。\n崦花时有蔟，溪鸟不成双。\n远树点黑矟，遥峰露碧幢。\n岩根瘦似壳，杉破腹如腔。\n䘨𧘈渔人服，筕篖野店窗\n多携白木锸，爱买紫泉缸。\n仙犬声音古，遗民意绪厖。\n何文堪纬地，底策可经邦。\n自此将妻子，归山不姓庞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33901.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33901","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}